W("Reference to context: 'In sports, that would be like making the big leagues at the age of fifteen and hitting a home run your first time at bat.' (i) What is being compared? (ii) What is the figure of speech? (iii) What does it show?", 3, "(i) The publication of the work of college students in a famous scientific journal for the first time, compared with a very young player scoring a home run on his first turn. (1) (ii) An analogy / extended comparison. (1) (iii) The rarity and greatness of Ebright's achievement. (1)", "M"),
