W("Character: Write three qualities of Ebright with evidence.", 3, "Curious: he asked what the gold spots were for. Determined: he raised thousands of monarchs and kept experimenting. Hardworking and all-round: he was a straight-A student, debater, canoeist and photographer. (1+1+1)", "M"),
